flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B[Reset OneWire bus]

    B --> C{OneWire reset successful}

    C -- No --> D[Print DS2413 reset failed message]
    D --> E[Return false]

    C -- Yes --> F[Send Match ROM command]

    F --> G[Set index j to 0]

    G --> H{Index j less than 8}

    H -- Yes --> I[Send ROM byte at index j]
    I --> J[Increment index j]
    J --> H

    H -- No --> K[Send Read PIO Registers command]

    K --> L[Read PIO logic state]

    L --> M[Print PIO data]

    M --> N{PIO data complement check valid}

    N -- No --> O[Print DS2413 PIO read error]
    O --> P[Return false]

    N -- Yes --> Q[Return true]
